{"id":"a24d8667957b1216","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-sequence-concatenation.md","title":"Sequence Concatenation","display":"df-sequence-concatenation — Sequence Concatenation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-sequence-concatenation","aliases":["90-df-sequence-concatenation","90-df-frown"],"display":"df-sequence-concatenation — Sequence Concatenation","depends_on":["[[90-df-sequence]]","[[90-df-sequence-encoding]]","[[90-df-iota-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-sequence-concatenation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-sequence-concatenation</span><span>90-df-frown</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sequence-concatenation — Sequence Concatenation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4293e1643a9254d8\" href=\"?note=4293e1643a9254d8\" title=\"90-df-sequence\">90-df-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5dc32170bd55a322\" href=\"?note=5dc32170bd55a322\" title=\"90-df-sequence-encoding\">90-df-sequence-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d54f327008e148ac\" href=\"?note=d54f327008e148ac\" title=\"90-df-iota-operator\">90-df-iota-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(s,m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Seq}(s)\">\\(\\operatorname{Seq}(s)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Seq},\\operatorname{Len},(s)_i\">\\(\\operatorname{Seq},\\operatorname{Len},(s)_i\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4293e1643a9254d8\" href=\"?note=4293e1643a9254d8\" title=\"90-df-sequence\">90-df-sequence</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 直接引用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d54f327008e148ac\" href=\"?note=d54f327008e148ac\" title=\"90-df-iota-operator\">90-df-iota-operator</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,m\">\\(s,m\\)</span> 是完整自由参数列。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nA(s,m,t)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Seq}(t)\\land\n\\operatorname{Len}(t)=\\operatorname{Len}(s)+1\\land\n(\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(s)\\ (t)_i=(s)_i)\\land\n(t)_{\\operatorname{Len}(s)}=m,\\\\\n\\forall s,m\\in\\mathbb N\\quad&amp;\\operatorname{Seq}(s)\\Longrightarrow\\exists!t\\in\\mathbb N\\ A(s,m,t),\\\\\ns\\frown m&amp;:=\\iota t\\,(t\\in\\mathbb N\\land A(s,m,t)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nA(s,m,t)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Seq}(t)\\land\n\\operatorname{Len}(t)=\\operatorname{Len}(s)+1\\land\n(\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(s)\\ (t)_i=(s)_i)\\land\n(t)_{\\operatorname{Len}(s)}=m,\\\\\n\\forall s,m\\in\\mathbb N\\quad&amp;\\operatorname{Seq}(s)\\Longrightarrow\\exists!t\\in\\mathbb N\\ A(s,m,t),\\\\\ns\\frown m&amp;:=\\iota t\\,(t\\in\\mathbb N\\land A(s,m,t)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>将解码出的有限列附加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 后重新编码给出存在见证，编码单射性给出唯一性。保留“给编码列追加一个自然数”的二元接口，不改成两个编码列的拼接；该接口仍只在合法序列码上使用，不额外总化原函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"4293e1643a9254d8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sequence-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"5dc32170bd55a322","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-sequence-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-iota-operator","status":"resolved","id":"d54f327008e148ac","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-iota-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"4293e1643a9254d8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s,m\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $\\operatorname{Seq}(s)$；$\\operatorname{Seq},\\operatorname{Len},(s)_i$ 见 [[90-df-sequence]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-iota-operator","status":"resolved","id":"d54f327008e148ac","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\iota$ 直接引用 [[90-df-iota-operator]]；$s,m$ 是完整自由参数列。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"s,m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Seq}(s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Seq},\\operatorname{Len},(s)_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"s,m","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nA(s,m,t)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Seq}(t)\\land\n\\operatorname{Len}(t)=\\operatorname{Len}(s)+1\\land\n(\\forall i<\\operatorname{Len}(s)\\ (t)_i=(s)_i)\\land\n(t)_{\\operatorname{Len}(s)}=m,\\\\\n\\forall s,m\\in\\mathbb N\\quad&\\operatorname{Seq}(s)\\Longrightarrow\\exists!t\\in\\mathbb N\\ A(s,m,t),\\\\\ns\\frown m&:=\\iota t\\,(t\\in\\mathbb N\\land A(s,m,t)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"m","display":false}],"bytes":1301,"backlinks":[{"id":"1cdf7925a164f89d","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\pi_{\\le i}(s)$ 与 $s\\frown m$ 只在 $\\operatorname{Seq}(s)$ 上取 [[90-df-prefix-projection]]、[[90-df-sequence-concatenation]] 的原接口。